ubuntu-insights provides a CMake package exposing its generated C API:

    find_package(ubuntu-insights CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(my_app PRIVATE ubuntu-insights::insights)

Include the C API header with:

    #include <insights/insights.h>

The `ubuntu-insights::insights` target is always available.

Enable the optional `tools` feature (`ubuntu-insights[tools]`) to build and expose the following executable targets:

    ubuntu-insights::client
    ubuntu-insights::web-service     (Linux only)
    ubuntu-insights::ingest-service  (Linux only)
